before:
Worked example:

```javascript
function updateVersion(record,expected,title) {
  if(record.version !== expected) return {status:409};
  return {status:200,record:{...record,title,version:record.version+1}};
}
console.log(updateVersion({"id":1,"title":"Moon","version":3}, 3, "Sea"));
```
The returned value is {"status":200,"record":{"id":1,"title":"Sea","version":4}}.

